From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Telesphoreo <me@telesphoreo.me>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:35:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Bound item component serialization work

Reject or strip component values whose encoded structure exceeds a shared complexity budget before codec traversal can stall the server. Apply the same rule to persistent and network boundaries so alternate component carriers cannot bypass it.

